<p>Converts a vector to a string.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/String%20keyword" title="String keyword">string</a> VectorToString(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Vector%20keyword" title="Vector keyword">vector</a> vVector<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">vVector<dd>The vector to convert
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>Returns the string representation of the vector. Returns an empty string on error.
</p>
</dl><dl><dt>Source:
<p><dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Script.ldf" title="Script.ldf">script.ldf</a>
</p>
</dl>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Returns the vector vVector in string format. This string will be of the form "x y z" where x,y and z
are the x,y and z floats contained in the vector vVector.
</p><p><br />
</p>
